OL,3,GNEWSAPostal deliveries delayed for
OL,4,Aweeks, residents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Bridgwater have hit out at
OL,7,Fpostal delays with some complaining
OL,8,Fthat important post, including bills
OL,9,Fand medical appointments, have not been
OL,10,Fdelivered.
OL,12,FResidents said the problems with Royal
OL,13,FMail deliveries in the Somerset town
OL,14,Fhave been going on for six months with
OL,15,Fsome post being delayed by weeks.
OL,17,FA Royal Mail spokesperson said some
OL,18,Fshort-term sickness had affected
OL,19,Fdeliveries.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
