OL,3,GNEWSAPostal deliveries delayed for
OL,4,Aweeks, residents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne Bridgwater resident, David Gliddon,
OL,7,Fsaid some people had taken "the extreme
OL,8,Fmeasure" of going to the sorting office
OL,9,Fto collect their post where, he said,
OL,10,Fwaiting times could be "up to an hour".
